      "ArticleTitle": "Influence of isosorbide 5-mononitrate 20 mg, sustained-release 50 mg and sustained-release nifedipine 20 mg on ischaemic ST-segment changes during Holter monitoring. A double-blind cross-over study in patients with spontaneous angina pectoris.",
